      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are worlds, like VOLT Club that allow a chair to swivel, albeit, using a button on the side of the chair.\nI could agree to having an avatar rotate on a chair using the right thumbstick, but it might be a little bit more complicated with desktop users.\nThis Canny post was uploaded earlier too. This specifies a bit more detail: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrc-station-mobile-rotation-lock",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
